CARLOS EMR on Ubuntu — package notes
====================================

This package installs a complete, single-host CARLOS EMR deployment: the
application, its database, a web application firewall, TLS, and backups. It is
the simple alternative to the container-based carlos-podman deployment
(https://github.com/carlos-emr/carlos-podman), for sites that want one
virtual machine and `apt install`.

  IT IS NOT A SUBSTITUTE FOR YOUR OWN REVIEW. Before this system holds patient
  information, complete your own technical, security, privacy, backup, restore
  and regulatory review. The sections marked "DECIDE THIS" below are the ones
  where the package deliberately cannot choose for you.


